00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:02.460
Iran's Riyal fell past 2.5 million to the dollar,

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:05.960
while Tehran waited on a United States reply over Hormuz.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.380
And by Saturday, a third American carrier was bound

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.580
for the Middle East as Iran was reported

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.820
